    <bpmn:process id="W_W4618" name="W4618. VAS General Ledger, Revenue Recognition &amp; Intercompany" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Close cycle (VS-17); revenue recognition
Frequency: Monthly/quarterly
Volume: VAS GL/revenue across the program
Owner: Finance (VS-17) / Tax (VS-79)
Participants: Treasury (VS-18), Compliance (VS-22), Audit (VS-21), Shared Services (VS-72)
Source: workflow W4618 — VAS General Ledger, Revenue Recognition &amp; Intercompany</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4618_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4618_Lane1" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4618_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4618_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4618_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4618_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4618_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4618_Start3" name="Close cycle (VS-17); revenue recognition">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4618_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4618_Task4" name="Finance account VAS activity in the GL (commission revenue, float, transaction…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance account VAS activity in the GL (commission revenue, float, transaction fees, refunds) per VS-17, with distinct cost-center per VAS line
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4618_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4618_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4618_Task5" name="Finance/Tax recognize revenue correctly (commission at settlement/earning, not…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/Tax recognize revenue correctly (commission at settlement/earning, not at transaction; VAT/withholding VS-79), and manage intercompany across 5 entities (VS-72)
Responsible (R): Finance / Tax
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4618_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4618_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4618_Task6" name="Finance/Audit ensure GL accuracy, reconcile to principals/cash (W4617/W4613)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Audit ensure GL accuracy, reconcile to principals/cash (W4617/W4613), and report VAS P&amp;L to commercial/board (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Finance / Audit
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4618_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4618_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4618_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4618_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4618_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-700 (ensure controlled execution — Settlement, Reconciliation, Compliance (AML/BSP) &amp; Analytics (PA-156.3).) | - CTL-700: VAS GL distinct/accurate (VS-17); revenue recognized per policy (VS-79); intercompany settled (VS-72); audited (VS-21)
Owner: Finance (VS-17) / Tax (VS-79)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4618_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4618_Annotation8" targetRef="W4618_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4618_Flow10" sourceRef="W4618_Start3" targetRef="W4618_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4618_Flow11" sourceRef="W4618_Task4" targetRef="W4618_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4618_Flow12" sourceRef="W4618_Task5" targetRef="W4618_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4618_Flow13" sourceRef="W4618_Task6" targetRef="W4618_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
