    <bpmn:process id="W_W4624" name="W4624. VAS Program Performance Review &amp; Strategic Adjustment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual review; strategic shift; underperformance
Frequency: Annual + on trigger
Volume: VAS program review &amp; strategic adjustment
Owner: COO / CFO / Commercial / Strategy (VS-33)
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), Legal (VS-100.3), Risk (VS-21.2), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4624 — VAS Program Performance Review &amp; Strategic Adjustment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4624_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4624_Lane1" name="COO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4624_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4624_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4624_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4624_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4624_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4624_Start3" name="Annual review; strategic shift; underperformance">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4624_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4624_Task4" name="COO/CFO/Strategy review the VAS program vs W4601 success metrics (footfall…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: COO/CFO/Strategy review the VAS program vs W4601 success metrics (footfall, basket-linkage, commission revenue, risk-adjusted return), and the strategic rationale
Responsible (R): COO / CFO / Strategy
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4624_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4624_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4624_Task5" name="COO/Strategy/Legal evaluate strategic adjustments (expand/restructure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: COO/Strategy/Legal evaluate strategic adjustments (expand/restructure portfolio, change partners, adjust store coverage, exit) if performance/rationale changes
Responsible (R): COO / Strategy / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: On trigger</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4624_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4624_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4624_Task6" name="COO/Commercial execute the chosen path (adjust portfolio/partners/stores…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: COO/Commercial execute the chosen path (adjust portfolio/partners/stores W4601/W4602–W4604), with OCM (VS-134), and report to the board (VS-36)
Responsible (R): COO / Commercial / OCM
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4624_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4624_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4624_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4624_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4624_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-700 (ensure controlled execution — Settlement, Reconciliation, Compliance (AML/BSP) &amp; Analytics (PA-156.3).) | - CTL-700: program reviewed vs success metrics (W4601); adjustments legal-validated (agency-only VS-100.3); board-reported (VS-36)
Owner: COO / CFO / Commercial / Strategy (VS-33)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
